      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Cholecystoenteric fistulas are often not diagnosed preoperatively and delineation of fistula can have an influence on surgical planning. We report a case of cholecystocolonic fistula diagnosed preoperatively using CT-i.v. cholangiography and review the published reports."},
